es. Yunlong Bai: software. Zulai Huang: validation. Xiaodong Guo: formal analysis. Donglai Shi: data curation. Xue Ding: conceptualization. Yi Ding: resources.</p><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="corresponding-author">Corresponding author</h3><p id="corresponding-author-list">Correspondence to
                <a id="corresp-c1" aria-label="email Xiaohong Zhang" href="mailto:gyfybiglove@foxmail.com">Xiaohong Zhang</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Ethics declarations"><div class="c-article-section" id="ethics-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="ethics">Ethics declarations</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="ethics-content">
            
            
              <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar1">Competing interests</h3>
              <p>The authors declare no competing interests.</p>
            
          </div></div></section><section data-title="Additional information"><div class="c-article-section" id="additional-information-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="additional-information">Additional information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="additional-information-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading">Publisher's Note</h3><p>Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations.</p><p>Recommended for publication by Commission XIX - Physics of Welding and Joining</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Rights and permissions"><div class="c-article-section" id="rightslink-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="rightslink">Rights and permissions</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="rightslink-content"><p>Springer Nature or its licensor (e.g. a society or other partner) holds exclusive rights to this article under a publishing agreement with the author(s) or other rightsholder(s); author self-archiving of the accepted manuscript version of this article is solely governed by the terms of such publishing agreement and applicable law.</p><p class="c-article-rights"><a data-track="click" data-track-action="view rights and permissions" data-track-label="link" href="https://s100.copyright.com/AppDispatchServlet?title=Welding%20and%20joining%20of%20aerospace%20materials%3A%20mechanisms%2C%20defects%2C%20and%20quality%20assurance%3A%20a%20review&amp;author=Zexue%20Lin%20et%20al&amp;contentID=10.1007%2Fs40194-026-02630-9&amp;copyright=International%20Institute%20of%20Welding&amp;publication=0043-2288&amp;publicationDate=2026-09-17&amp;publisherName=SpringerNature&amp;orderBeanReset=true">Reprints and permissions</a></p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="article-info" data-title="About this article"><div class="c-article-sectio